<h1>Delete this report?</h1>

<p class="caveat is-warning">
    There is no undo. The report, its screenshot and whatever else it
    carried are removed from disk, and the line that says it existed is
    taken out of the index.
</p>

<div class="confirm">
    <dl class="railed">
        <dt>Reported</dt>
        <dd><%= id %></dd>

        <dt>Page</dt>
        <dd><%= document.dig("page", "url") %></dd>

        <% unless document["message"].to_s.empty? %>
            <dt>Message</dt>
            <dd><%= document["message"] %></dd>
        <% end %>

        <dt>Files</dt>
        <dd><%= files.join(", ") %></dd>
    </dl>

    <form class="states" method="post" action="<%= to("/#{id}/delete", false) %>">
        <input type="hidden" name="confirm" value="yes">
        <button class="is-danger" name="delete" value="yes">Delete for good</button>
        <a class="button" href="<%= to("/#{id}", false) %>">Keep it</a>
    </form>
</div>

<p class="empty">
    To take it out of the list without destroying it, go back and
    archive it instead.
</p>
